WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:35.230 --> 01:36.630
Sensei?

01:42.790 --> 01:45.330
Oh Sensei!

01:44.290 --> 01:45.870
FUN CAMPING

01:44.290 --> 01:45.870
TRIP

01:44.290 --> 01:45.870
GUIDE

02:00.630 --> 02:02.310
Sensei you...

02:04.830 --> 02:06.310
...dirty boy.

02:07.440 --> 02:10.370
I just felt a chill down my spine.

02:11.130 --> 02:13.190
Aoki-sensei, do you have a cold?

02:13.530 --> 02:19.460
It'll put a damper on summer's main
event - the fun, fun camping trip.

02:16.690 --> 02:19.860
FUN CAMPING

02:16.690 --> 02:19.860
TRIP

02:16.690 --> 02:19.860
GUIDE

02:19.460 --> 02:20.520
Fun?

02:21.550 --> 02:24.180
Fun my left eye, it'll be a nightmare.

02:24.180 --> 02:24.910
Huh?

02:24.910 --> 02:26.810
Be quiet!

02:25.370 --> 02:30.210
We're taking kids who are uncontrollable in class out to a public location,

02:30.210 --> 02:31.960
and keeping them there overnight?!

02:33.710 --> 02:36.710
Even now I can see the
chaos in front of me.

02:36.710 --> 02:41.130
Hmph, do you want to know
a good way to handle them?

02:41.130 --> 02:42.840
Yes, Senpai!

02:44.090 --> 02:45.720
All you need to do is...

02:47.010 --> 02:49.350
Wear them out by running them up and down!

02:49.350 --> 02:53.090
By night they'll be too tired to put up a fuss!

02:53.810 --> 02:56.440
<i>So that's what school camping
trips are all about?</i>

02:56.940 --> 03:01.910
SCHOOL
CAMPING
TRIP

02:56.940 --> 03:01.910
7th
Period

03:00.290 --> 03:01.950
Gather round!

03:01.950 --> 03:03.670
Are you listening?

03:03.670 --> 03:08.770
Listen to your teachers, don't go off doing your own thing!

03:08.770 --> 03:13.290
Stay in the specified areas and be on time!

03:08.770 --> 03:10.870
Huh, a parasol?

03:10.870 --> 03:13.290
I stopped with the tanned, feminine look.

03:13.290 --> 03:15.460
That goes especially for you two...

03:15.460 --> 03:18.610
Listen to what I say, got it?

03:19.650 --> 03:21.090
Okay!

03:26.150 --> 03:29.230
<i>Sensei, you've stirred a hornets' nest!</i>

03:29.790 --> 03:31.770
All right, let's go!

03:31.770 --> 03:33.730
Okay!

03:38.150 --> 03:41.860
Hey, kids, keep it down a skosh!

03:42.190 --> 03:44.070
Geez...

03:44.070 --> 03:46.950
Kokonoe, quit pressing up against me!

03:46.950 --> 03:49.620
But it's <i>soo</i> crowded!

03:54.870 --> 03:56.670
H... Hey!

03:57.450 --> 03:59.130
Use your inside voice!

03:59.130 --> 04:01.310
Stop that!

04:01.310 --> 04:02.670
You like?

04:02.670 --> 04:03.380
Don't be stup-

04:04.070 --> 04:08.390
Maybe I should yell out,
"This guy's a groper!" instead.

04:08.390 --> 04:12.270
<i>You little... sexual predator girl!</i>

04:12.270 --> 04:15.440
This guy's a groper!

04:15.440 --> 04:17.190
We got a groper!

04:17.190 --> 04:18.480
Groper!

04:18.480 --> 04:21.740
No, they're wrong! I'm their teacher!

04:22.110 --> 04:24.050
Kagami! Kokonoe!

04:24.050 --> 04:25.890
Won't they shut up?

04:25.890 --> 04:28.410
Can't that teacher get his act together?

04:30.110 --> 04:33.110
Guys... be quiet...

04:33.120 --> 04:35.370
NEXT

04:33.120 --> 04:35.370
ODEJISHI

04:35.370 --> 04:39.130
Please wait for the doors to open.

04:39.130 --> 04:41.830
Odejishi... Odejishi.

04:41.830 --> 04:45.890
When alighting the train, be sure to take all belongings with you.

04:42.630 --> 04:45.890
Hey, we're not getting off yet. Make way.

04:49.490 --> 04:51.480
Caution, the doors are closing.

04:51.480 --> 04:53.650
Please refrain from last-minute boarding.

05:00.890 --> 05:04.790
<i>If I were just an ordinary private employee,</i>

05:04.790 --> 05:09.390
<i>I too would be thinking that
those kids are too damn noisy.</i>

05:13.750 --> 05:16.460
HANNOU STATION

05:14.510 --> 05:16.330
Are we clear?

05:16.330 --> 05:18.880
We're walking till we hit the mountain trail entrance.

05:19.230 --> 05:24.360
Divide into your groups, watch
out for cars, and let's go!

05:24.360 --> 05:26.300
Okay!

05:27.030 --> 05:29.890
"Make the summit by noon, take roll."

05:29.890 --> 05:34.640
"After lunch, do recreational activities, bring the stuff to the cabins, make curry..."

05:35.210 --> 05:37.810
All right, let's go on our merry way!

05:37.810 --> 05:39.150
Okay!

05:39.480 --> 05:39.520
HANNOU MOUNTAIN TRAIL GUIDE

05:43.870 --> 05:46.960
Everyone, be sure to follow us!

05:46.960 --> 05:48.660
Okay!

06:05.310 --> 06:06.840
It's a stream!

06:06.840 --> 06:09.150
It looks so refreshing!

06:09.150 --> 06:12.710
Hey, can't you three hurry
up and get moving?

06:12.710 --> 06:14.770
Everyone's left you behind!

06:14.770 --> 06:17.930
Sensei, where's your love of nature?

06:17.930 --> 06:19.800
Ugh, you're so uncivilized.

06:20.850 --> 06:24.310
Seriously, who wears that
outfit to the mountains?

06:24.310 --> 06:26.470
Not to mention that parasol!

06:26.470 --> 06:30.070
What the hell? Uppity little virgin!

06:31.030 --> 06:33.580
<i>You're a virgin too, you know!</i>

06:33.890 --> 06:35.630
Don't worry!

06:35.630 --> 06:38.510
<i>I'll</i> be your first, Sensei!

06:38.510 --> 06:40.330
<i>Not good!</i>

06:40.330 --> 06:41.610
Kokonoe!

06:41.610 --> 06:42.330
No!

06:43.730 --> 06:45.300
Call me "Rin."

06:46.750 --> 06:49.300
Hurry up and get going!

06:49.840 --> 06:51.930
Oh man...

06:51.930 --> 06:56.110
Maybe I should have just became a salaryman.

06:56.110 --> 06:57.150
Sensei...

06:57.150 --> 06:57.810
Hmm?

06:57.810 --> 07:00.290
What is it, Usa?

07:00.290 --> 07:04.060
Um... I... have to pee!

07:04.060 --> 07:06.330
Huh? You have to pee?

07:08.070 --> 07:10.700
There's no bathroom until we hit the peak.

07:10.700 --> 07:13.550
Well, you'll just have to go
somewhere around here.

07:13.550 --> 07:15.830
Huh?!

07:20.580 --> 07:23.470
Sensei, don't look over here!

07:23.470 --> 07:24.530
Okay!

07:24.530 --> 07:25.810
<i>Like I will.</i>

07:26.510 --> 07:28.570
And don't listen either!

07:28.570 --> 07:30.310
<i>I'm not listening!</i>

07:34.220 --> 07:35.050
Oh...

07:35.850 --> 07:38.850
Uh-oh. It's already lunch time!

07:39.290 --> 07:40.890
Usa, hurry up!

07:41.770 --> 07:43.610
Wait a second!

07:43.610 --> 07:45.110
I <i>am</i> waiting! Hurry!

07:46.950 --> 07:49.370
Huh, where are Mimi-chan and Sensei?

07:49.370 --> 07:51.490
Now that you mentioned it...

07:53.860 --> 07:55.470
We're running to the top!

07:55.470 --> 07:57.700
Um, I still have to pee...

07:56.780 --> 07:58.870
Hey, let me down, you moron!

07:58.870 --> 08:02.250
No fair! Hold me too!

08:06.630 --> 08:09.730
Sensei, what about our lunches?

08:09.730 --> 08:13.650
Oh, yeah... just wait a little longer!

08:13.650 --> 08:16.970
Oh... Aoki-sensei, what are you doing?

08:17.990 --> 08:19.010
Hmm?

08:22.640 --> 08:24.470
Just made it-

08:31.400 --> 08:32.790
Say "ahh..."

08:53.050 --> 08:57.390
We're pleased to meet you, Manager-san!

08:57.390 --> 08:59.810
Yes, nice to meet you all too!

08:59.810 --> 09:03.390
Every year you Futatsubashi
kids are so lively.

09:04.050 --> 09:05.760
Pleasure to have you.

09:05.760 --> 09:07.000
Sure thing!

09:07.000 --> 09:08.280
Ah, Sensei...

09:08.280 --> 09:10.520
...we've got some luggages delivered here.

09:10.520 --> 09:11.810
Luggages?

09:11.810 --> 09:12.280
Oh!

09:12.630 --> 09:13.690
Those are mine!

09:13.690 --> 09:15.310
What are these?

09:15.310 --> 09:18.160
Those should have my
negligee and baby doll.

09:18.570 --> 09:22.130
Along with the aroma oil for after I take my baths, body lotion,

09:22.130 --> 09:24.910
electric toothbrush, nail cleaner,

09:25.310 --> 09:29.460
and my Noir Ferret the Black
Donkey that I sleep with.

09:29.860 --> 09:32.090
Please have these sent back immediately.

09:32.090 --> 09:34.050
You're such a Nazi!

09:45.270 --> 09:47.050
That doesn't look very safe.

09:47.050 --> 09:48.830
You do it like this.

09:50.870 --> 09:53.280
Sensei, you're good!

09:53.280 --> 09:56.550
Gee, Sensei, you sure know how to peel skin!

09:56.550 --> 09:58.510
Wh... What are you...?

09:58.510 --> 10:05.390
Heh? I just thought you knew how to
peel skin since you cook for yourself!

10:05.390 --> 10:09.350
Sensei, what <i>were</i> you thinking
when she said "peel skin"?

10:09.350 --> 10:11.110
Yeah, what?

10:18.760 --> 10:19.760
Oh, man!

10:20.410 --> 10:21.510
Wow!

10:21.510 --> 10:24.020
I was the one who cut those carrots.

10:23.250 --> 10:24.020
Really?

10:24.020 --> 10:25.010
Try it!

10:25.010 --> 10:25.720
They're great!

10:25.890 --> 10:27.610
You're taking too much!

10:31.630 --> 10:34.130
Looks like things have settled down.

10:34.130 --> 10:37.210
Well I'm on the verge of collapse.

10:37.210 --> 10:41.130
This counselor thing is tougher than I figured.

10:41.130 --> 10:43.790
And we still have a long way to go.

10:47.690 --> 10:48.750
What if...

10:48.750 --> 10:50.250
Eh?

10:50.250 --> 10:56.350
What if things were a lot easier if I became a salaryman instead of a teacher.

10:56.350 --> 10:57.570
Oh...

10:57.570 --> 11:00.710
Aren't the flames just making you wistful?

11:01.730 --> 11:03.260
Maybe so!

11:15.690 --> 11:18.030
Aww, nighttime already?

11:18.670 --> 11:22.650
The day just flew right past, and there were more stuff I wanted to do.

11:22.650 --> 11:24.500
What are you talking about?

11:24.500 --> 11:25.160
Huh?

11:25.160 --> 11:29.040
The night is young, and so are we!

11:30.690 --> 11:32.530
Is there something wrong?

11:32.530 --> 11:35.340
No... just this chill...

11:35.340 --> 11:36.170
Hmm?

11:43.320 --> 11:44.700
What a big bath!

11:43.400 --> 11:45.470
WOMEN

11:44.700 --> 11:45.470
Wow!

11:45.470 --> 11:48.270
Be sure to take turns while washing!

11:48.270 --> 11:50.230
Okay!

11:50.230 --> 11:54.710
And here I thought she was stuffing while wearing a Wonder Bra or something!

11:54.710 --> 11:56.480
They're the real deal.

11:57.380 --> 12:02.170
<i>I always get barbs of jealousy whenever I take baths with other women.</i>

12:02.170 --> 12:03.490
Sensei...

12:04.690 --> 12:06.240
You poor thing.

12:07.340 --> 12:10.270
<i>Then again, there's being pitied...</i>

12:12.970 --> 12:15.250
This is heaven!

12:15.250 --> 12:18.250
Large baths are really nice!

12:18.810 --> 12:19.710
Oh...

12:21.670 --> 12:22.510
Kuro-chan?

12:22.510 --> 12:24.290
What's up?

12:24.290 --> 12:27.890
Just wondering if the virgin really <i>can</i> peel back his own skin.

12:28.280 --> 12:29.640
You devil!

12:29.640 --> 12:32.140
Just call me a naughty little angel.

12:32.140 --> 12:33.670
Good job, angel!

12:33.670 --> 12:35.030
Eh? Where are you guys going?

12:35.030 --> 12:39.150
Hey, wait! Did you at least
count to a hundred?

12:39.150 --> 12:40.900
MEN'S
BATH

12:39.150 --> 12:40.900
WOMEN'S
BATH

12:42.380 --> 12:44.400
Wait for meee!

12:44.400 --> 12:46.910
Ooh, wow! So big!

12:44.400 --> 12:46.910
MEN'S BATH

12:46.910 --> 12:49.450
Hey, let's check it out!

12:49.450 --> 12:51.230
Boing, boing!

12:51.880 --> 12:54.310
Fellas...

12:54.310 --> 12:58.090
Why are you being so obvious
with what you're up to?

12:58.090 --> 13:01.920
Umm... sorry!

13:02.250 --> 13:04.590
What can you do?

13:04.590 --> 13:08.990
These camping trips are all about boys trying to peek in on baths.

13:08.990 --> 13:11.610
It's like a cherished tradition.

13:11.610 --> 13:15.440
They'd always hide themselves
around here in order to snoop...

13:15.440 --> 13:16.440
Hmm?

13:19.440 --> 13:22.130
Hey!

13:22.130 --> 13:24.400
Wait!

13:24.870 --> 13:26.570
Hold up!

13:31.390 --> 13:34.170
I'm the one who should be screaming!

13:35.080 --> 13:37.080
MEN'S
BATH

13:35.080 --> 13:37.080
WOMEN'S
BATH

13:39.880 --> 13:40.910
Didja see?

13:40.910 --> 13:42.950
Not a thing.

13:42.950 --> 13:44.590
Did you see anything, Mimi-chan?

13:44.590 --> 13:47.090
How was it?

13:49.110 --> 13:52.660
Grown ups are... grown ups are...

13:52.660 --> 13:53.430
Huh?

13:58.910 --> 14:00.150
Tada!

14:00.150 --> 14:02.650
Oh, how cute!

14:03.950 --> 14:06.190
I bought this especially for today.

14:06.190 --> 14:08.610
Hey, look at me, Rin-chan... huh?

14:13.150 --> 14:14.550
Rin-chan!

14:14.550 --> 14:15.160
Huh?

14:15.160 --> 14:18.170
Oh, it's cute, it's cute.

14:18.170 --> 14:19.890
I'm going to the bathroom.

14:23.090 --> 14:26.610
Something's up.... something's definitely up.

14:30.420 --> 14:32.300
No pillow fights!

14:33.770 --> 14:35.310
At 3:00 at night...

14:35.310 --> 14:38.250
Under the tree behind the gymnasium...

14:38.250 --> 14:39.700
No ghost stories!

14:39.700 --> 14:41.480
No porno mags!

14:41.480 --> 14:43.820
No sabbats!

14:48.190 --> 14:51.770
Will I be able to make it
to morning in one piece?

14:52.850 --> 14:53.490
Oh...

14:54.250 --> 14:56.470
And the last one has...

15:00.250 --> 15:00.970
Oh?

15:00.970 --> 15:04.000
Looks like they're sleeping peacefully.

15:04.000 --> 15:05.530
Good, good.

15:06.800 --> 15:09.260
Gotcha!

15:07.770 --> 15:09.260
Kagami!

15:09.260 --> 15:14.390
Those luggages you sent back had the pillow I always sleep with!

15:14.770 --> 15:15.470
Eh?

15:15.470 --> 15:17.770
I can't sleep with a different pillow!

15:17.770 --> 15:21.520
How will you make up for it? Lack of
sleep is a skin's worst enemy!

15:21.520 --> 15:24.250
That's a mouthful you put there...

15:24.250 --> 15:25.020
Huh?

15:25.020 --> 15:26.130
Where's Kokonoe?

15:26.130 --> 15:29.460
The bathroom! Anyways, you'd better take responsibility for that!

15:29.460 --> 15:31.350
R... Responsibility?

15:32.030 --> 15:41.150
Sleep, sleep... lay down and
sleep, oh lay down and sleep...

15:41.150 --> 15:46.710
You are such a good little boy-

15:45.680 --> 15:47.890
Put more B-flat into it!

15:47.890 --> 15:52.650
Sleep, sleep... lay down and sleep...

15:52.650 --> 15:57.110
<i>I am not letting him leave till
Rin-chan gets back. Never!</i>

16:11.190 --> 16:13.470
I'm bushed.

16:13.470 --> 16:16.970
I just wanna flop down and
forget about everything...

16:16.970 --> 16:18.030
Mm?

16:19.290 --> 16:22.470
K... Kokonoe! Why are you...?

16:26.310 --> 16:28.800
Sensei, you're late...

16:28.800 --> 16:30.550
Get off of me!

16:30.550 --> 16:34.430
That's mean. I've been waiting forever.

16:33.090 --> 16:34.430
No one asked you!

16:34.430 --> 16:37.830
Come on, off you go to your own cabin.

16:37.830 --> 16:38.560
Uh-

16:38.560 --> 16:41.310
Aoki-sensei, are you in there?

16:41.310 --> 16:42.360
Yes!

16:42.360 --> 16:44.350
Do you have a minute?

16:43.990 --> 16:44.350
Sure d-

16:44.770 --> 16:46.050
Pipe down!

16:46.050 --> 16:48.010
Can you give me a second?

16:48.010 --> 16:49.070
Not a muscle!

16:50.990 --> 16:53.070
Is... Is there something wrong?

16:53.070 --> 16:55.490
No, I....

16:55.490 --> 16:57.320
I'm just a little worried.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.310
Huh?

17:01.450 --> 17:02.740
Aoki-sensei?

17:02.740 --> 17:07.330
Oh, it's nothing. Still, today
was really exhausting.

17:08.240 --> 17:10.450
You're right about that.

17:10.450 --> 17:13.170
No, you're really right about that.

17:13.170 --> 17:15.890
For both the body and the soul...

17:17.340 --> 17:23.730
Um, I think it's really great that
you came to Futatsubashi.

17:23.730 --> 17:25.050
Eh?

17:25.050 --> 17:27.730
Being a teacher isn't an easy path.

17:28.230 --> 17:33.740
I'm really glad to meet someone like you who's earnest and upfront with the kids,

17:33.740 --> 17:36.360
even if your skills are lacking.

17:37.250 --> 17:39.090
Houin-sensei...

17:39.090 --> 17:41.670
That's all I wanted to say.

17:41.670 --> 17:43.470
Well then, good night!

17:43.470 --> 17:45.730
Yes, good night!

17:53.330 --> 17:55.370
How awkward was that?

17:55.370 --> 17:58.890
He probably thinks I'm too annoying.

17:58.890 --> 18:03.090
On top of that, he didn't
even let me into his room...

18:03.890 --> 18:09.150
Ahh! This is a wholesome camping
trip - what's wrong with me?!

18:10.930 --> 18:13.310
Kokonoe, all clear now.

18:13.310 --> 18:14.230
Hm?

18:15.240 --> 18:17.170
Where did she go?

18:17.170 --> 18:17.950
Sensei?

18:17.950 --> 18:18.740
Oh...

18:22.490 --> 18:24.250
Kokonoe! That outfit-

18:24.250 --> 18:26.370
Houin-sensei said so herself.

18:26.890 --> 18:29.370
You should be earnest
and upfront with the kids.

18:29.370 --> 18:31.880
Only if those kids are actually
wearing something!

18:31.880 --> 18:33.630
I <i>will</i> make noise.

18:34.810 --> 18:36.520
Make all the noise you want.

18:36.520 --> 18:39.390
Be it "Groper!" or
"He's forcing himself on me!"

18:39.390 --> 18:42.810
Houin-sensei is sure to believe me.

18:42.810 --> 18:46.370
When I say I'll make noise, that's not the noise I'm talking about.

18:46.370 --> 18:47.020
Eh?

18:49.020 --> 18:51.020
Wait! Hold on!

18:51.640 --> 18:53.110
No, not there-

18:53.110 --> 18:55.270
Come on, stop that!

18:59.970 --> 19:02.870
<i>Mornings come early in the mountains.</i>

19:03.790 --> 19:08.370
<i>By the time I finally got through to
Kokonoe, it already became this late.</i>

19:10.850 --> 19:13.910
<i>She's an angel only when she's asleep.</i>

19:15.390 --> 19:17.470
Is that it?

19:17.090 --> 19:17.210
M
I
S
S

19:17.470 --> 19:18.720
Aww!

19:18.720 --> 19:20.340
It's a miss!

19:20.340 --> 19:23.020
It's the eighth! The eighth card!

19:22.270 --> 19:25.210
The fifth one has to be around here!

19:25.210 --> 19:25.810
Seriously?

19:28.140 --> 19:30.110
What's wrong with you three?

19:30.110 --> 19:33.330
You can't do orienteering if you're like that!

